```

---

**The dependency flow is now clean:**
```
cargo build -p mdix-ffi
    └─→ writes MdixNative.cs into Core/Generated/   (self-contained)

dotnet build Core
    └─→ compiles MdixNative.cs + all Core/*.cs → Core.dll

dotnet pack Core  (after CI fills runtimes/)
    └─→ MidManStudio.Mdix.1.0.0.nupkg
          lib/netstandard2.1/MidManStudio.Mdix.Core.dll
          runtimes/win-x64/native/mdix_ffi.dll
          runtimes/linux-x64/native/libmdix_ffi.so
          runtimes/osx-arm64/native/libmdix_ffi.dylib
          ...
          build/MidManStudio.Mdix.targets

Unity Package (later, separate work)
    └─→ drops pre-built Core.dll into Runtime/Core/Plugins/
    └─→ copies native libs into Runtime/Plugins/{Platform}/
